meta {
  name: 22-account-email-flows
  seq: 22
}

docs {
  Account flows that the official server runs through email: sign-up
  verification, email change, email verification, one-time codes, deleting an
  account from a recovery link, the password hint.

  NodeWarden has no email delivery and answers most of them with 501 on purpose.
  These requests record which paths follow that decision and which ones have no
  route at all.
}
